<title>USA: Dillard buys five Mervyn's store locations.</title>
<headline>Dillard buys five Mervyn's store locations.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillard Department Stores Inc will assume operations at five Florida regional shopping malls owned and managed by Simon DeBartolo Group Inc, the real estate company said.</p>
<p>Dillard's will move into stores previously operated by Mervyn's, a unit of Dayton Hudson Corp.</p>
<p>Dillard's also acquired a former Mervyn's at Cutler Ridge Mall in Miami, which is managed by Simon DeBartolo's affiliated management company on behalf of third-party owners.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
